## Design Decisions

- **Compressor:** ON at boot, OFF during night mode, ON at morning. No cooldown. No max runtime enforcement. Shop compressor with own pressure switch handles all regulation.
- **Burst-cycled relays:** Exempt from relay cycle limits. Only the compressor (if it were a fridge-type) would need rate limiting.
- **Manual override:** Activate override on first toggle only. Subsequent toggles within 10-min window must not re-trigger `stopHumidityOutputs()`.
- **Relay identify:** Simple JS button that toggles at 2Hz for 5 seconds via WebSocket commands. No backend changes.
